  "title": "Deals-first demo page",
  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>CampusEats</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,sans-serif;background:#fffaf0;color:#2a1a05}\nnav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 32px;font-weight:700}\nnav b{color:#e11d48;font-size:20px}\n.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fde68a,#fb923c);padding:56px 32px;text-align:center}\n.badge{display:inline-block;background:#e11d48;color:#fff;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px}\nh1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 auto 14px;max-width:680px}\n.hero p{font-size:18px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 24px;opacity:.85}\n.cta{display:inline-block;background:#e11d48;color:#fff;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:16px}\n.strip{display:flex;gap:24px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\n.cards{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:40px 24px}\n.card{background:#fff;color:#222;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;width:220px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}\n.card h3{margin:0 0 6px}.card p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#666;font-size:14px}\n.card span{color:#e11d48;font-weight:800;font-size:18px}\n</style></head><body>\n<nav><b>CampusEats</b><span>Menu &middot; Orders &middot; Help</span></nav>\n<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"badge\">STUDENT DEALS &middot; MEALS FROM Rs 50</div><h1>The cheapest meals on campus. Period.</h1><p>Combo deals, hostel-friendly prices and free delivery over Rs 150. Eat well on a student budget.</p><a class=\"cta\">Grab today&rsquo;s deals</a></div>\n<div class=\"strip\"><span>Save up to 35%</span><span>Free delivery over Rs 150</span><span>Student-ID discount</span></div>\n<div class=\"cards\"><div class=\"card\"><h3>Biryani Combo</h3><p>Biryani + raita + drink</p><span>Rs 90 <s style='color:#999;font-weight:400'>Rs 140</s></span></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Roll Duo</h3><p>Two paneer rolls</p><span>Rs 60</span></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Cold Coffee</h3><p>Large, extra ice</p><span>Rs 50</span></div></div>\n</body></html>",
  "rationale": "Positioning 'Cheap' for college students drives a warm, loud deals layout with prices, savings and a free-delivery offer.",
  "depends_on_node_ids": [
    "r3",
    "r5"
  ]
}